## Dynamic PDO parsing
Parse to intermediate representation:


Go from
#[derive(Debug, Clone)]
pub enum PDOMessage {
    TPDO1(TPDO1Message),
    TPDO2(TPDO2Message),
    TPDO3(TPDO3Message),
    TPDO4(TPDO4Message),
    RPDO1(RPDO1Message),
    RPDO2(RPDO2Message),
    RPDO3(RPDO3Message),
    RPDO4(RPDO4Message),
    Raw(RawPDOMessage),
}
To =>
pub struct PDOMessage {
  type: enum T/RPDO(n)
  raw: RawPDOMessage,
}

